@host = https://localhost:5001
@token = paste-token-here

### Issue a token with write scope
POST {{host}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "user-123",
  "scope": "quotes.write"
}

### Claim-based policy: requires scope=quotes.write
PUT {{host}}/quotes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated quote"
}

### Custom policy: requires the user to own the route quoteId
DELETE {{host}}/quotes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
